# Google Maps Platform API Key (public client key loaded via SvelteKit $env/dynamic/public)
#
# Quickstart for Prototyping (Free Maps Demo Key — No Billing Account or Cloud Project Required):
#   1. Open https://mapsplatform.google.com/maps-demo-key?utm_campaign=gmp_git_agentsamples_v1.0.0
#   2. Sign in with any Google account.
#   3. Accept the Maps Demo Project Terms when prompted.
#   4. Click the button to generate / reveal your Maps Demo Key.
#   5. Copy this file to `.env` (`cp .env.example .env`) and replace the placeholder below.
#
# Note: The Maps Demo Key has daily quota limits and is NOT for production use.
# For Production: Create a restricted API key in Google Cloud Console
# (https://console.cloud.google.com/google/maps-apis/credentials?utm_campaign=gmp_git_agentsamples_v1.0.0)
# with Maps JavaScript API, Places API (New), Routes API, and Elevation API enabled,
# and restrict it by HTTP referrer and designated APIs.
PUBLIC_GOOGLE_MAPS_API_KEY=your_google_maps_api_key_here
